      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule id="b6486ba4-bc37-5dbe-bf6c-bed5b2bef8c7" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 10-10" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 10
KYTAN DAEMON ENGINE OF KHORNE — 525 POINTS
WS 5; BS 3; S 10; Front 13; Side 13; Rear 11; I 5; A 4; HP 6.
Unit Composition: 1 Kytan Daemon Engine. Unit Type: Vehicle (Super-heavy Walker).
Wargear: Kytan gatling cannon; Great Cleaver of Khorne.
Special Rules: Daemon; Daemonforge; Fleet; Crusader; It Will Not Die; Rage; Unstoppable Slaughter; Super-heavy Walker rules (Fear, Hammer of Wrath, Invincible Behemoth, Move Through Cover, Relentless, Smash and Strikedown).
Unstoppable Slaughter: If the Kytan destroys a target in its Shooting phase with its attacks, it may charge a different target in the Assault phase.
Kytan gatling cannon: Range 48"; S 8; AP 3; Heavy 8, Pinning.
Great Cleaver of Khorne: Range -; S D; AP 1; Melee.
Selection note from source: may be used as a Lords of War choice in Chaos Space Marines, Khorne Daemonkin or Chaos Daemons; in Khorne Daemonkin it has Blood for the Blood God; it may be selected instead of a Khorne Lord of Skulls where that war machine is available.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
      <ns0:costs>
        <ns0:cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="525.0" />
      </ns0:costs>
    </ns0:selectionEntry>
