      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule id="99b8e223-9ce3-5543-96d1-01f0f33e0c6e" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 28-28" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 28
WORD BEARERS PROCURATORS – ELITES CHOICE - 120 POINTS
                                WS        BS         S          T          W         I          A          LD

Procurator                      4          4         4          4          1         4          2          8

Procurant                       4          4         4          4          1         4          2          9

UNIT TYPE                                                       UNIT COMPOSITION

Procurant – Infantry (Character)                                4 Procurator

Procurator – Infantry                                           1 Procurant

WARGEAR                                                                    SPECIAL RULES

     •    Chainsword                                                       Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)
     •    Bolt Pistol                                                      Chosen Warriors
     •    Frag and Krak Grenades                                           Grim Purpose
     •    Power armor (Procurators only)                                   Flesh Harvesters
     •    Artificer armor (Procurant only)                                 Traitor
     •    Narthecium (Procurant only)


DEDICATED TRANSPORT

A Word Bearers Procurator squad numbering no more than 10 models that have not selected jump packs may purchase a
Legion Rhino as a dedicated transport.

     A Procurator squad may include

     •    Up to 10 additional Procurators – 15 points each

The entire squad may take jump packs for 10 points a model

Any procurator may exchange their chainsword for

     •    Heavy Chainsword – 5 points each
     •    Power weapon – 10 points each

For every five models in the squad, one procurant may

     •    Exchange their chainsword for a power fist for 15 points
     •    Exchange their bolt pistol for a hand flamer for 10 points each
     •    Exchange their bolt pistol for a plasma pistol for 15 points each

A Word Bearers Procurator Squad may take Dark Channeling for 25 points

GRIM PURPOSE

A unit that includes any models with this special rule may not be joined by any model that does not also have this special rule.

FLESH HARVESTERS

Friendly models within 6’ of any model with this special rule may add 1 to any dice rolled for attempts to manifest warp charge points. In
most cases, this means that most warp charge points can be successfully manifested on a 3+. Additionally, in missions that use victory
points; for every enemy unit that is removed as a casualty as a result of a sweeping advance by models with this special rule- the
controlling player gains +1 victory point.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
      <ns0:costs>
        <ns0:cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120.0" />
      </ns0:costs>
