        <ns0:rule id="c936548a-cb45-57b7-9c7d-22bec55aa891" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 39-39" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 39
CALLIDUS ASSASSIN 145 POINTS

                                WS         BS         S           T         W           I        A          LD

Callidus Assassin               8          8          4           4         3           7        4          10

UNIT TYPE – Infantry (Character)                                            UNIT COMPOSITION

                                                                  1 Callidus Assassin

WARGEAR                                                                     SPECIAL RULES

     •     Neural shredder                                        Fearless
     •     Phase sword                                            Independent Operative
     •     Poison Blades                                          Infiltrate
                                                                  Fleet
                                                                  Hit &amp; Run
                                                                  Lightning Reflexes
                                                                  Move Through Cover
                                                                  No Escape
                                                                  Precision Strikes


CALLIDUS TEMPLE EXITUS WEAPONS

Neural Shredder

Range                 S         AP         TYPE

Template              1         2          Pistol, Neural Shock

Neural Shock: Hits caused by this weapon always wound on a 4+. This special rule has no effect on buildings or vehicles.

Phase Sword

Range      S          AP        TYPE

-          User       2         Melee, Phasing hits

Phasing Hits: Each successful to wound roll of a 6 made by a phase sword results in a phasing wound. Invulnerable saves may not be
taken against phasing wounds.

Poison Blades

Range      S          AP        TYPE

-          User       -         Melee, Poisoned (3+), Rending

Polymorphine:

When a Callidus Assassin is deployed using her Infiltrate special rule, she can be set up anywhere on the table that is more than I" from
any enemy unit, whether deployed enemy units can draw a line of sight to her or not. If a Callidus Assassin starts the game in Reserves,
she can choose to move on from the enemy board edge when she arrives. In cither case, during the first game turn, or during the game
turn in which the Callidus Assassin arrives from Reserves, encmy units can only fire Snap Shots when targeting her.

Reign of Confusion:

If your army includes a Callidus Assassin, you can re-roll the dice when attempting to Seize the Initiative. In addition, your opponent
suffers -3 to the first Reserve Roll they make during the game.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
