        <ns0:rule id="1d368ffc-dff6-56ef-a244-a2dc7bf05737" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 40-40" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 40
EVERSOR ASSASSIN 135 POINTS

                                   WS       BS        S         T         W          I          A         LD

Eversor Assassin                   8         8        4         4         3          7          4          10

UNIT TYPE – Infantry (Character)                                          UNIT COMPOSITION

                                                                1 Eversor Assassin

WARGEAR                                                                   SPECIAL RULES

     •    Executioner pistol                                    Fearless
     •    Neuro-gauntlet                                        Independent Operative
     •    Power sword                                           Infiltrate
     •    Melta bombs                                           Lightning Reflexes
     •    Frenzon                                               Feel no pain
     •    Sentinel Array                                        Furious Charge
                                                                Move Through Cover
                                                                No Escape


WARGEAR OF THE EVERSOR TEMPLE

EXECUTIONER PISTOL

                                            Range     S         AP        TYPE

                     Needle pistol          12”        1        -         Pistol, Poisoned

                     Bolt Pistol            12”       4         5         Pistol

NEURO-GAUNTLET

Range     S          AP            TYPE

-         User       -             Melee, Fleshbane, Shred

Frenzon

An Eversor Assassin rolls 3D6 when determining his charge range, adding the results together. In addition, an Eversor
Assassin receives 3 bonus Attacks in a turn in which he charged, rather than just 1.

Sentinel Array

An Eversor Assassin fires Overwatch using his full Ballistic Skill

Bio-meltdown:

If an Eversor Assassin is ever reduced to zero Wounds, before removing the model as a casualty, each nearby unit (friend or foc) suffers a
Strength 5 AP- hit for each model it has within D6" of the Eversor Assassin. After resolving any additional damage, remove the Eversor
Assassin from play as a casualty.

Fast Shot:

Whenever an Eversor Assassin fires his executioner pistol, he does so 4 times. All of these shots must be at the same target, but can be
any mixture of bolt pistol and needle pistol shots.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
