      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule id="ae92a83d-1194-57e1-8775-6cf535159b23" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 44-44" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 44
VANUS INFOCYTE ASSASSIN 125 POINTS

                               WS         BS         S         T          W          I         A          LD

Vanus Infocyte Assassin        8           8         4         4          3          7         4           10

UNIT TYPE – Infantry (Character)                                          UNIT COMPOSITION

                                                               1 Vanus Infocyte Assassin

WARGEAR                                                                   SPECIAL RULES

     •    Auspectre                                            Fearless
     •    Two Las Pistols                                      Independent Operative
     •    Two Sympatic Dataspikes                              Infiltrate
     •    Voxdisruptor Array                                   Lightning Reflexes
     •    Automic Servo-Limbs                                  Move Through Cover
                                                               No Escape
                                                               Noospheric Interloper




WARGEAR OF THE ADAMUS TEMPLE

Auspectre

Enemy models cannot be deployed using the Infiltrate special rule within 18" of a model with an auspectre. In addition, when any enemy
unit is deployed to the battlefield from Reserves, a model with an auspectre may make an attack as if it had the Interceptor special rule.
Instead of using the profile of a weapon the model has, a model with an auspectre may instead make a Leadership test. If the Leadership
test is passed, the controlling player may instead make a Shooting Attack with any weapon available to any Vehicle (both friendly or
enemy) within 12", that is in range and line of sight of the targeted model. The weapon that was fired counts as having fired with the
interceptor rule in the next shooting phase. If the Leadership test is failed, nothing happens.



Noospheric Interloper

Instead of making a Shooting Attack, a model with this special rule may make a Leadership test. If this test is passed, the controlling
player may nominate a single enemy model within 12" that has the Cybernetica Cortex special rule – this model immediately suffers D3
Wounds with no Armour Saves or Damage Mitigation rolls allowed. If this reduces the model to 0 Wounds and it is removed as a casualty,
the controlling player may nominate another model with the Cybernetica Cortex special rule within 18" of the model with this special
rule. This model also suffers D3 Wounds with no Armour Saves or Damage Mitigation rolls allowed. Regardless of the result of this dice
roll, no further Wounds may be allocated by this attack in any one Shooting phase. If the Leadership test is failed, the Vanus Infocyte
immediately suffers a single Wound with no Armour Saves or Damage Mitigation rolls allowed, and there are no further effects.



Sympatic Dataspikes

Range     S          AP        TYPE

-         +2         3         Melee, Rending, Haywire, Specialist Weapon

Autotomic Servo-limbs

Once per battle, at the start of any turn, the controlling player of a model with autotomic servo-limbs may choose to grant that model the
Hit &amp; Run special rule until the start of their next turn</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
