     •     The Blade of Shadows                                  Daemon of the Ruinstorm
                                                                 Eternal Warrior
                                                                 Vanguard of Hell
                                                                 Lord of Chaos
                                                                 Parting the Veil
                                                                 Tide of Madness
                                                                 Shadow Form
                                                                 Lord of Torment
                                                                 Psyker (Mastery level 3)
                                                                 (Be’lakor knows all of the powers from the Telepathy discipline)

WARLORD TRAIT

Whist the warlord is alive, all enemy units have a -1 penalty to their leadership when making fear tests.

Shadow Form

Be’lakor has a 4+ invulnerable save and the shrouded special rule. Furthermore, Be’lakor automatically passes dangerous terrain tests

Lord of Torment

If one or more enemy units failed a morale check during the previous turn, Be’lakor receives D3 additional warp charge points at the start
of his turn.

The Blade of Shadows

           S         AP         TYPE

           +1        2          Melee, Armourbane, Fleshbane, Master-crafted, Specialist weapon</ns0:description>
