      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule id="323cf4d3-5605-5c31-b4b0-ed99787f7a17" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 49-49" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 49
SOLAR AUXILIA AETHON HEAVY SENTINEL SQUADRON – HEAVY SUPPORT - 70 points + upgrades

WS        BS     S       FRONT            SIDE              REAR         I       A     HP

3         3      6           12            12               10           3       2     3

Unit Composition                                                                 UNIT TYPE

1 Aethon Heavy Sentinel                                                          Vehicle (Walker)

      •   Vehicle (Walker)

WARGEAR                                                                          SPECIAL RULES

      •   Multi Laser                                                            Move Through Cover
      •   Aethon Missile Battery

OPTIONS

The Aethon Heavy Sentinel Squadron may take up to 2 additional Aethon Heavy Sentinels for 70
points each.

Aethon Heavy Sentinels may replace their Multi-laser with one of the following Options:

      •   Autocannon – 10 points
      •   Volkite Culverin – 10 points
      •   Lascannon – 20 points
      •   Heavy Incinerator – 15 points
      •   Melta Lance – 25 points

Any model may replace the Aethon Missile Battery with 4 Hunter Killer Missiles for 20 points.

Aethon Missile Battery

RANGE            STR     AP       TYPE

30”              4       5        Assault 1, Large Blast, Barrage, Twin-linked

Heavy Incinerator

RANGE            STR     AP       TYPE

Template          6      4        Assault 1, Torrent (6”)

Melta Lance

RANGE            STR     AP       TYPE

18               8       1        Heavy 1, Armourbane</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
