        <ns0:rule id="827253ec-02c9-58fd-814a-d8135c9136f1" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 50-50" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 50
HAMMERFALL BUNKER – FORTIFICATION CHOICE – 150 points
                            FRONT SIDE         REAR     HP

                            14        14       14       4

TERRAIN TYPE – medium Fortification (emplacement)                         UNIT COMPOSITION -1 HAMMERFALL BUNKER

TRANSPORT CAPACITY, FIRE POINTS - None



         WARGEAR                                                                    SPECIAL RULES

    -    One turret mounted Twin Linked Cyclone missile launcher                    Hammerfall Strike
         (With frag, krak and hyperios missiles)                                    Senty Defence System
    -    One hull mounted twin linked heavy bolter                                  Fully Automated
         (front)
    -    One hull mounted twin linked heavy bolter
         (left)
    -    One hull mounted twin linked heavy bolter
         (right)
    -    One hull mounted twin linked heavy bolter
         (back)

         OPTIONS
    -    The hammerfall bunker may replace all of its twin linked heavy bolters with twin linked heavy flamers
         for no additional points cost.
    -    No other options or upgrades may be taken


Hammerfall Strike

A model with this special rule is deployed anywhere on the Battlefield that is at least 12" from any point within the
opposing Player's Deployment Zone or any enemy models, after models with the Scout or Infiltrate special rules. If both
players have models with this special rule, roll off to see who will deploy them first.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
