      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule id="9016d56b-1393-5aec-8e9b-c571444f1f0a" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 53-53" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 53
LEGION PRAETOR IN SATURNINE TERMINATOR ARMOUR- HQ CHOICE - 200 POINTS
                          WS      BS       S        T       W        I        A        LD

Saturnine Praetor         6        5       4        5        5       4        4        10



UNIT TYPE                                           UNIT COMPOSITION

Saturnine Praetor – Infantry (Character)            1 Saturnine Praetor

WARGEAR                                                     SPECIAL RULES

    •   Saturnine disruption fist                           Legiones Astartes
    •   Legion Saturnine Terminator armor                   Master of the Legion
    •   Thermal diffraction grid                            Independent Character
    •   Saturnine War Axe

        OPTIONS
    -   This model may have its Saturnine War Axe or Saturnine Disruption Fists Exchanged for one
        Saturnine Concussion Hammer for 10 points.

    -   This model may purchase a Plasma Blaster for 10 points.

    -   This model may have a Saturnine Teleportation transponder purchased for it for 60 points.


Saturnine Teleportation transponder

A model with a Saturnine Teleportation transponder gains the Deep strike special rule. If this model is in a unit
entirely composed of models equipped with Saturnine Terminator armor, they all gain the Deep Strike rule.

Saturnine Praetor Weapons

Saturnine War Axe

RANGE        S            AP      TYPE

Melee       +1            2       Melee, Reaping Blow, Murderous Strike, Specialist weapon



Saturnine Concussion Hammer

RANGE        S            AP      TYPE

Melee       10            2       Melee, Unwieldy, Murderous Strike, Specialist weapon</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
      <ns0:costs>
        <ns0:cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="200.0" />
      </ns0:costs>
    </ns0:selectionEntry>
