        <ns0:rule id="6e93c883-76a3-5613-bca3-42b994981e2c" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 54-55" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 54
LEGION SATURNINE DREADNOUGHT- HEAVY SUPPORT CHOICE - 340 POINTS


WS       BS      S       FRONT              SIDE          REAR               I   A   HP

5        5       8         13                13            12                3   2   5



UNIT TYPE                                          UNIT COMPOSITION

Saturnine Dreadnought – Vehicle (Walker)           1 Saturnine Dreadnought

WARGEAR                                                   SPECIAL RULES

     •   Twin Linked Disintegrator Cannon                 Slow and Purposeful
     •   Heavy Plasma Bombard
     •   Two photonic incinerators
     •   Thermal diffraction grid
     •   Searchlight
     •   Smoke Launchers
     •   Armoured Ceramite
     •   Extra Armor
     •   Flare Shield
     •   Reinforced Atomantic Shielding



         OPTIONS
         This Model may have its heavy plasma bombard exchanged for one of the following:
     -   Disintegrator Cannon – 10 points
     -   Inversion Beamer – 10 points
     -   Graviton Pulveriser - 10 points

         This Model may have its Twin Linked disintegrator cannon exchanged for one of the
         following:
     -   heavy plasma bombard – 10 points
     -   Inversion Beamer – 10 points
     -   Graviton Pulveriser - 10 points

         Both of this Model's photonic incinerators may be exchanged for one of the
         following:
     -   Two concussive Resonators – 10 points
     -   Two heavy Particle Shredders – 10 points

PAGE 55
SATURNINE DREADNOUGHT WEAPONS


Arm Weapons:

Heavy Plasma Bombard

      RANGE            S       AP   TYPE

      36’              7       2    Heavy 1, Large Blast, Gets hot, Barrage.

Inversion Beamer

      RANGE            S       AP   TYPE

      Up to 15”        10      1    Heavy 1, Large Blast, Firing Calibration

      15”- 30”         8       4    Heavy 1, Large Blast, Firing Calibration

Graviton Pulveriser
      RANGE            S       AP   TYPE

      18’              9       2    Heavy 1, Small Blast, Rending, Haywire, Concussive.

                                    ignores cover

Chest Weapons:

Photonic Incinerator

      RANGE                S   AP   TYPE

      Template             6   4    Heavy 1

Concussive Resonator

      RANGE                S   AP   TYPE

      Template             6   5    Heavy 2, Gets Hot, Concussive

Heavy Particle Shredder

      RANGE            S       AP   TYPE

      Template         6       3    Heavy 1, Rending, Gets hot</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
