      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule id="2266c393-b660-5006-a3f6-18332b9101a2" name="HH3 Port Source Rules - pp. 63-65" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 63
Fulgrim Transfigured............................................600 Points – LORD OF WAR CHOICE
          WS        BS        S         T           W      I         A         LD

          8         6         7         7           7      8         7         10



UNIT TYPE – Flying Monstrous Creature (Character)                    UNIT COMPOSITION

                                                                               1 (Unique)



WARGEAR                                                              SPECIAL RULES

• Blades of the Pheonician                                           Daemon

• Serpentine Daemonform                                              Scion of Corruption (Emperor’s Children)

                                                                     Sublime Swordsman

                                                                     Psyker (Mastery level 2)

                                                                     Warlord: Avatar of Perfection

                                                                     Primarch (Eternal warrior, Adamantium Will, Fleet,
                                                                     Fearless, It Will Not Die, Master of the Legion, Precision
                                                                     strikes, Precision Shots.)

Warlord Trait – Avatar of Perfection:

If chosen as the army's Warlord, Fulgrim Transfigured automatically has the Avatar of Perfection Warlord Trait and may not
select any other Warlord Trait.

Avatar of Perfection - During the controlling player's Charge sub-phase, Fulgrim Transfigured must attempt a Charge if
there are any enemy units that contain any models with an unmodified Weapon Skill characteristic of 6 or more within 12",
and at least one of these enemy units must be declared as a target of that Charge. Note that this does allow a unit that
contains a model with this Warlord Trait to Charge a different unit to one that they made a Shooting Attack against in the
previous Shooting phase. In the subsequent Fight sub-phase, the controlling player must issue a Challenge, and must
nominate Fulgrim to be the Challenger. If the Challenge is accepted by an enemy model with a Weapon Skill
characteristic of 6, while that Challenge is ongoing, Attacks made for Fulgrim Transfigured hit on a result of 2+, regardless
of the Weapon Skill characteristic of the target.

Serpentine Daemonform - provides a 2+ Armour Save and a 4+ Invulnerable Save. Additionally, while Fulgrim
Transfigured has four or fewer wounds, add +1 to dice rolls made for his It Will Not Die Special Rule. If, at the start of any
of their player turns, Fulgrim Transfigured has two or fewer Wounds and is not locked in combat, his controlling player
may choose to remove Fulgrim Transfigured from play as a casualty. If Fulgrim Transfigured is removed from play in this
manner, the opposing player achieves no Objectives or Secondary Objectives that would otherwise be scored by
removing Fulgrim Transfigured as a casualty.

PAGE 64
Blades of the Phoenician - At the start of each combat, Fulgrim Transfigured's controlling player must choose one of the
following profiles to use:

Decapitating Slashes

         S         AP        TYPE

         User      2         Melee, Instant Death

Sundering Blows

         S         AP        TYPE

         +3        2         Melee, Wrathful Blows, Instant Death, Unwieldy




Wrathful Blows: A model making Attacks with this weapon makes 3 attacks with it only. Regardless of their Attacks
Characteristic and any bonuses gained for Charging and for the sublime swordsman special rule.

 Scion of Corruption (Emperor’s Children) - All units with the Legiones Astartes (Emperor's Children) special rule in an
army that includes Fulgrim Transfigured must replace it with the Legiones Hereticus (Emperor's Children) special rule.
You also cannot include Fulgrim Transfigured in the same army as Fulgrim. Fulgrim Transfigured is Psyker with a mastery
level of 2 and can only generate powers from the Discipline of Excess from the Chaos Daemons book which is included in
these rules. Furthermore, Fulgrim Transfigured counts as being able to use the Lords of Profligacy special rule. Fulgrim
Transfigured counts as a Daemon of Slaanesh as well, meaning that all of his attacks have the Rending special rule and
can always run an additional 3”.

Sublime Swordsman:

In an assault, Fulgrim’s invulnerable save is increased to 3+. In addition, when fighting in a challenge, he gains a number
of additional attacks equal to the amount which his initiative value is greater than that of his opponent so, for example, if
he fights a model with an initiative value of 5, Fulgrim’s initiative of 8 grants him 3 extra attacks.

PAGE 65
DISCIPLINE OF EXCESS
Primaris — Lash of Slaanesh (Warp Charge 1): Beam; Range 24", S6 AP-, Assault 1, Rending.
1 Acquiescence (WC1): Malediction, enemy within 18"; -5 Initiative (minimum 1), cannot Counter-attack or Overwatch while active.
2 Pavane of Slaanesh (WC1): Focused Witchfire, Range 24"; target takes a Leadership test; if failed suffers one Wound with no Armour or Cover save. If slain, randomly select another model in the unit and repeat until a test is passed or the unit is destroyed.
3 Maniacal Fervour (WC1): Blessing, friendly unit within 24"; immediately suffers D6 S3 AP- hits; while active gains Furious Charge, Rage and Zealot.
4 Phantasmagoria (WC1): Malediction, enemy within 18"; whenever it attempts to move, manifest, Run, shoot, charge, attack, fight, Sweep, Consolidate or Overwatch, it must first pass a Leadership test or cannot perform that action. A failed action does not prevent a different action later in the phase, which requires a separate test.
5 Slicing Shards (WC2): Witchfire; Range 24", S4 AP4, Assault 1, Large Blast, Soul Flay. Soul Flay: after resolving the blast, units wholly or partially under it take a Leadership test or suffer D6 S4 AP4 hits.
6 Cacophonic Choir (WC2): Nova, Range 12"; each target rolls 2D6 and subtracts Leadership, suffering that many Wounds with no Armour or Cover saves, then takes a Pinning test.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
      <ns0:costs>
        <ns0:cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="600.0" />
      </ns0:costs>
