        <ns0:cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0.0" />
      </ns0:costs>
    </ns0:selectionEntry>
    <ns0:selectionEntry id="fe3186c4-d3e3-5cf7-941d-f3629180b9b9" name="Knight Preceptor" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <ns0:modifiers>
        <ns0:modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
          <ns0:conditions>
            <ns0:condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="e22f91fc-2eff-5193-b02a-1bb1921864f0" type="equalTo" />
          </ns0:conditions>
        </ns0:modifier>
      </ns0:modifiers>
      <ns0:categoryLinks>
        <ns0:categoryLink id="65e668fb-97fe-5eea-b087-07bb86993af0" hidden="false" targetId="94323054-901d-5dcb-9611-10c363ce7bfa" primary="true" />
      </ns0:categoryLinks>
      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule id="fbdd2d8d-3efb-592e-89e9-6c1396f90a1b" name="HH3 Port Rules - pp. 18-18" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 18
Knight Preceptor – 360 points + upgrades

WS       BS    S       FRONT           SIDE         REAR         I   A     HP

4        4     10          13           12           12          4   3     6

UNIT TYPE

     •   Vehicle (Super-heavy walker)

WARGEAR

     •   Multi Laser
     •   Las Impulsor
     •   Thunderstrike Gauntlet
     •   Ion Shield

SPECIAL RULES

     •   Household Rank
     •   Super-heavy walker

OPTIONS

The Questoris Knight Preceptor may take one of the following carapace weapons

     •   Ironstorm missile pod – 30 points
     •   Twin Icarus Autocannon – 35 points
     •   Stormspear rocket pod – 40 points

The Questoris Knight Preceptor may exchange its Thunderstrike gauntlet for a Reaper
Chainsword for free.

The Questoris Knight Preceptor may be upgraded with Occular augmentics for 10 points

LAS IMPULSOR

(RANGED)

RANGE          STR     AP       TYPE

8’             10      2        Heavy 2, sunder, instant death

(MELEE)

STR      AP    TYPE

D        1     MELEE</ns0:description>
