     •    Chainsword (Life Ward only)                           Legiones Astartes (Thousand Sons)
     •    Bolt Pistol                                           Battlesmith (Numerologist only)
     •    Frag and Krak Grenades                                Numerologist Order (Numerologist only)
     •    Power armor (Life Ward only)                          Life Warded (Numerologist only)
     •    Artificer armor (Numerologist only)                   Psyker (Numerologist only)
     •    Servo Arm (Numerologist only)
     •    Force Axe (Numerologist only)

DEDICATED TRANSPORT

A Thousand Sons Numerologist Cabal squad numbering no more than 10 models may purchase a Legion Rhino Transport
as a dedicated transport.

OPTIONS

The Thousand Sons Numerologist Cabal may include up to 5 additional Life Wards for 10 points Each

The Numerologist may take a Cyber Familiar for 15 points

The Numerologist may take one of the following

     •    Master-crafted bolter
     •    Combi-weapon – 10 points
     •    Volkite Charger – 10 points
     •    Plasma Pistol – 10 points
     •    Graviton Gun – 20 points
     •    Flamer – 10 points
     •    Plasma Gun – 15 points
     •    Melta gun – 20 points

The Numerologist exchange his force axe for a thunder hammer for 15 points

One Life Ward may take a nuncio vox for 10 points

One Life Ward may take an Augury Scanner for 10 points

One Life Ward may exchange his Chainsword for one of the following options

     •    Power Fist – 15 points
     •    Power Weapon – 5 points

For every five models in the unit, one Life Ward may exchange his bolt pistol and Chainsword for one of the following

     •    Rotor Cannon with Asphyx shells – 5 points each
     •    Volkite Caliver – 10 points each

PAGE 31
Special Rules

Numerologist Order

A model with this special rule has the Psy synchronicity psychic power and may not select any other
psychic powers

Psy-Synchronicity (Psychic Power)                                                 WARP CHARGE: 2

This is a Blessing which targets the psyker’s unit. Whist the power is in effect, The thousand sons player
may reroll all failed reserves rolls they make. In addition, up to two friendly units entirely composed of
models with the Legiones Astartes (Thousand Sons) special rule with one or more models within 6” of any
models under this effect gain a bonus of +1 BS during the shooting phase so long as models with this
psychic power do not make a shooting attack in the shooting phase.

LIFE WARDED

A Numerologist automatically passes all look out sir! Rolls. Additionally, a unit that includes models with
this special rule may not be joined by any model that does not also have this special rule.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
