        <ns0:rule id="47439bb6-4c65-5a1b-a0e6-def0804af46a" name="HH3 Port Rules - pp. 36-36" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 36
VHEREN ASHURHADDON....................................205 Points – HQ CHOICE
           WS           BS        S          T           W          I          A           LD

           7            5         4          4           3          5          4           10

UNIT TYPE – Infantry (Character)                                                           UNIT COMPOSITION

                                                                                           1 (Unique)

WARGEAR                                                                        SPECIAL RULES

• The Axe Serpentis                                                            Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus)

• Banestrike Fusilade                                                          Master of the Legion

• Close Combat Weapon                                                          Independent Character

• Frag and Krak grenades                                                       Precision Shots

• Melta Bombs                                                                  Precision Strikes

• Panoply of the Void                                                          Counter Attack

                                                                               Stubborn

                                                                               The First Reaver

                                                                               Traitor

Warlord Trait: Blood and Honor

If chosen as the army’s Warlord, Vheren Ashurhaddon automatically has Blood and Honor as his Warlord Trait and may not select any other.

Blood and Honor – When a wound is allocated to Vheren Ashurhaddon and he chooses to not use the Look out, sir! Special rule when he normally
could, he may reroll failed invulnerable saves.

Panoply of the Void - The Panoply of the Void grants Vheren Ashurhaddon a 2+ Armour Save and 4+ Invulnerable Save. In addition, any attacks
made by enemy models as part of a Shooting Attack that target Vheren Ashurhaddon or the unit he has joined (as long as that unit is composed of
no more than 6 models after Vheren Ashurhaddon has joined it), count the range to Vheren Ashurhaddon or his unit as 3" further than the actual
range between the two units. This special rule does not affect determining whether Vherren Ashurhaddon or models in the same unit are Hit by
Blast markers or weapons with the Template special rule.

The First Reaver - A single Reaver Attack Squad may be selected as part of the same choice as Vheren Ashurhaddon. A unit selected in this
manner is considered a ‘Retinue Squad’ and Vherren Ashurhaddon is referred to as the Retinue Squad’s Leader for the purposes of this special
rule. The Retinue Squad does not use up a Force Organisation slot and is considered part of the same unit as Vheren Ashurhaddon. The Retinue
Squad must be deployed with Vheren Ashurhaddon deployed as part of the unit and Vheren Ashurhaddon may not voluntarily leave the Retinue
Squad during play. A Reaver Attack Squad selected in this manner gains the Implacable Advance special rule. Note that no model may select
more than one Retinue Squad as part of the same choice, even if more than one option for such a unit is available.

The Axe Serpentis

           S            AP        TYPE

           User         2         Melee, Sudden Strike, Murderous Strike

Sudden Strike: On a turn in which a model with this special rule made a successful charge, they may gain +1 initiative.

Banestrike Fusilade

           Range        S         AP         TYPE

           10’          4         5          Pistol 4, Banestrike</ns0:description>
