     •    Needlespine blaster                                   Independent Operative
                                                                Infiltrate
                                                                Lightning Reflexes
                                                                Move Through Cover
                                                                No Escape
                                                                Fleet

WARGEAR OF THE ADAMUS TEMPLE

Nemesii Blade

                                           Range     S          AP         TYPE

                                           -         +1             3      Melee, Rending



Needlespine Blaster

. A needlespine blaster counts as a combi-weapon and a model can make a Shooting Attack with both primary and secondary
components each shooting phase.

                                           Range     S          AP         TYPE

                      Needlespine blaster 12”         2         -          Pistol 1, Fleshbane, Pinning

                      Bolt Blaster         12”       4          5          Pistol 3

Decapitation Strike

During any Fight sub-phase, the controlling player of a model with this special rule may choose to have the model with the special rule
make a single attack with the profile below instead of attacking normally (while using this option, the model with this special rule may not
gain bonus attacks for Charging, additional weapons or from any other special rule):

                                           Range     S          AP         TYPE

                                           -         2              1      Melee, Unwieldy, Fleshbane, Instant Death

Death’s Artisan

When Engaged in a Challenge, a model with this special rule may choose to increase their Weapon Skill and Initiative Characteristics to
match that of their opponent for the duration of the Challenge. Additionally, a model with this special rule must always issue a challenge
when Engaged in a combat with a unit that contains a character.

PAGE 43
VENENUM ASSASSIN 125 POINTS

                               WS         BS         S          T         W          I         A          LD

Venenum Assassin               8           8         4          4         3          7         4           10

UNIT TYPE – Infantry (Character)                                          UNIT COMPOSITION

                                                                1 Venenum Assassin

WARGEAR                                                                   SPECIAL RULES

     •    Hookfang                                              Fearless
     •    Toxin Ejector                                         Independent Operative
     •    Poison Globes                                         Infiltrate
                                                                Lightning Reflexes
                                                                Move Through Cover
                                                                No Escape
                                                                Feel No Pain


WARGEAR OF THE ADAMUS TEMPLE

Unnatural Conditioning

Models with this special rule are immune to the effects of the Rad-phage special rule and any other rules that negatively affect their
Toughness Characteristic, such as rad grenades. Additionally, weapons with the Poisoned special rule and/or Fleshbane special rule
may never wound a model with Unnatural Conditioning on a roll of better than 5+.

Poison Globes

unit attempting to make a Charge against a unit with one or more models that has poison globes must re-roll the first successful roll
when determining Charge distance.

Toxin Ejector

Range     S          AP        TYPE

Template 5           4         Assault 1, Poison (3+) Rending

Hookfang

Range     S          AP        TYPE

     -    user        3        Melee, Poisoned (3+), The Venem

The Venem:

 If a model suffers one or more unsaved Wounds from this weapon, the controlling player must roll a D6 at the beginning of every battle
turn for the remainder of the battle. On a 5+, the model suffers a Wound against which no saves of any kind may be taken. Furthermore,
any model which suffers one or more unsaved Wounds from a weapon with The Venem special rule is considered to be destroyed for the
purposes of missions which award Victory points for killing models (regardless of whether they have been removed from play as a
casualty), unless they possess the Eternal Warrior special rule

PAGE 44
VANUS INFOCYTE ASSASSIN 125 POINTS

                               WS         BS         S         T          W          I         A          LD

Vanus Infocyte Assassin        8           8         4         4          3          7         4           10

UNIT TYPE – Infantry (Character)                                          UNIT COMPOSITION

                                                               1 Vanus Infocyte Assassin

WARGEAR                                                                   SPECIAL RULES

     •    Auspectre                                            Fearless
     •    Two Las Pistols                                      Independent Operative
     •    Two Sympatic Dataspikes                              Infiltrate
     •    Voxdisruptor Array                                   Lightning Reflexes
     •    Automic Servo-Limbs                                  Move Through Cover
                                                               No Escape
                                                               Noospheric Interloper




WARGEAR OF THE ADAMUS TEMPLE

Auspectre

Enemy models cannot be deployed using the Infiltrate special rule within 18" of a model with an auspectre. In addition, when any enemy
unit is deployed to the battlefield from Reserves, a model with an auspectre may make an attack as if it had the Interceptor special rule.
Instead of using the profile of a weapon the model has, a model with an auspectre may instead make a Leadership test. If the Leadership
test is passed, the controlling player may instead make a Shooting Attack with any weapon available to any Vehicle (both friendly or
enemy) within 12", that is in range and line of sight of the targeted model. The weapon that was fired counts as having fired with the
interceptor rule in the next shooting phase. If the Leadership test is failed, nothing happens.



Noospheric Interloper

Instead of making a Shooting Attack, a model with this special rule may make a Leadership test. If this test is passed, the controlling
player may nominate a single enemy model within 12" that has the Cybernetica Cortex special rule – this model immediately suffers D3
Wounds with no Armour Saves or Damage Mitigation rolls allowed. If this reduces the model to 0 Wounds and it is removed as a casualty,
the controlling player may nominate another model with the Cybernetica Cortex special rule within 18" of the model with this special
rule. This model also suffers D3 Wounds with no Armour Saves or Damage Mitigation rolls allowed. Regardless of the result of this dice
roll, no further Wounds may be allocated by this attack in any one Shooting phase. If the Leadership test is failed, the Vanus Infocyte
immediately suffers a single Wound with no Armour Saves or Damage Mitigation rolls allowed, and there are no further effects.



Sympatic Dataspikes

Range     S          AP        TYPE

-         +2         3         Melee, Rending, Haywire, Specialist Weapon

Autotomic Servo-limbs

Once per battle, at the start of any turn, the controlling player of a model with autotomic servo-limbs may choose to grant that model the
Hit &amp; Run special rule until the start of their next turn</ns0:description>
