      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule id="ac2b6004-1887-51e0-a25f-6d83173830ef" name="HH3 Port Rules - pp. 56-56" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 56
Disintegrator Weapons and Additions


Legion Nullificator Squad
        Any Legion Nullificator may replace their Combi bolter for a Disintegrator Blaster for 20 Points.

Legion Veteran Squads
        Legion Veteran Squads may replace their Bolt guns with one of the following

    -   Volkite Charger – 5 points
    -   Disintegrator Rifle – 10 points

        Legion Veteran Sergeants may replace their bolt pistol with a Disintegrator Pistol for 15 points.

        For Every 5 models in a Legion Veteran Squad, one Veteran may replace their bolt gun with one of the
        following:
        Disintegrator Blaster – 15 points
        Heavy Disintegrator – 25 points

