        <ns0:categoryLink id="a01170cf-3ac0-59a7-8c56-db2f5f55554e" hidden="false" targetId="a10cd975-b606-5fb2-a525-30a822572658" primary="true" />
      </ns0:categoryLinks>
      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule id="215ebc04-9e7a-559b-89ad-3b27a9f813db" name="HH 1.41 Disintegration Weapons" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>PAGE 56
Disintegrator Weapons and Additions


Legion Nullificator Squad
        Any Legion Nullificator may replace their Combi bolter for a Disintegrator Blaster for 20 Points.

Legion Veteran Squads
        Legion Veteran Squads may replace their Bolt guns with one of the following

    -   Volkite Charger – 5 points
    -   Disintegrator Rifle – 10 points

        Legion Veteran Sergeants may replace their bolt pistol with a Disintegrator Pistol for 15 points.

        For Every 5 models in a Legion Veteran Squad, one Veteran may replace their bolt gun with one of the
        following:
        Disintegrator Blaster – 15 points
        Heavy Disintegrator – 25 points

Heavy Disintegrator

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        24’            6          2       Rapid Fire, Gets Hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Cannon

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        24”            9          2       Heavy 2, Gets hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Rifle

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        24’            4          3       Assault 1, Gets hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Blaster

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        18’            5          2       Rapid fire, Gets hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Pistol

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        12’            4          3       Pistol 1, Gets Hot!, Instant Death</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
      <ns0:costs>
        <ns0:cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="25.0" />
      </ns0:costs>
      <ns0:constraints>
        <ns0:constraint field="selections" scope="force" value="4.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="9cea9014-78bb-5257-a4bf-f580ca0506e4" type="max" />
      </ns0:constraints>
    </ns0:selectionEntry>
